# Compatibility pointer for operators who previously used this example directly.
#
# The canonical KAORI host-ingress configuration is now:
#   deploy/nginx/kaori.conf.template
#
# Do not copy this file directly into /etc/nginx. Render and install the
# canonical template through:
#   sudo bash deploy/nginx/bootstrap-ingress.sh --domain kaori.cloud --email <acme-email>
#
# That flow preserves the required unknown-host rejection, ACME bootstrap,
# TLS configuration, loopback-only upstream, and renewal validation contract.
